OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are some hosepipe bans still
OL,4,Ain place?
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter the summer of record-breaking
OL,7,Fheat, rivers and reservoir levels have
OL,8,Fremained low, prompting water suppliers
OL,9,Fto take action to maintain supply.
OL,11,FMillions of people across the West of
OL,12,FEngland continue to live under hosepipe
OL,13,Fbans, restricting activities like
OL,14,Fwatering gardens, cleaning cars and
OL,15,Ffilling swimming and paddling pools.
OL,17,FHowever, recent rainfall meant Bristol
OL,18,FWater was able to lift the ban for its
OL,19,Fcustomers in Bristol, parts of Somerset
OL,20,Fand a small area of Gloucestershire.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
