OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are some hosepipe bans still
OL,4,Ain place?
OL,5,
OL,6,FWessex Water, South West Water and
OL,7,FThames Water are yet to lift their
OL,8,Fbans, but have thanked their customers
OL,9,Ffor their continued careful water use.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
